[{"title":"自赞","author":"释法薰","text":"处世昏昏，临事草草。\n太近实头，人谓古老。\n是非到耳，风吹石臼。\n只有一般，最不恰好。\n解骑三脚驴，来往长安道。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14576,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自赞 其一","author":"释法薰","text":"人弃我取，人夺我与。\n涉世全乖，独行无侣。\n超佛越祖当头句，冷泉日夜滔滔举。\n敛手忌言坐闲处，可怜也被丹青污。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14577,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观音思惟像赞","author":"释法薰","text":"苦海深，悲愿广。\n作是思惟，云何方便。\n普使群生登彼岸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14578,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观音赞 其一","author":"释法薰","text":"入正定，作正观。\n众生受苦，我心何安。\n随类现身无处觅，天风卷海夜涛寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14579,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观音赞 其二","author":"释法薰","text":"闻声闻无所闻，见色见非是见。\n燕坐盘陀，不定不乱。\n尽大地悉證圆通，我方满度生悲愿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14580,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"达磨赞 其二","author":"释法薰","text":"我东土人，一性纯真。\n被他明破，不直半文。\n皮肉骨髓，狼藉分争。\n当时若药得死，今日定见太平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14581,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"达磨赞 其三","author":"释法薰","text":"孟浪到梁朝，不契梁朝意。\n放过一著，走入魏地。\n神光谩说安心，未免失却一臂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14582,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"达磨赞 其一","author":"释法薰","text":"白璧暗投，遭他按剑。\n折得茎芦，还冲巨浪。\n阖国人追亦不回，掩羞赖有闲和尚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14583,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨岐和尚赞","author":"释法薰","text":"不会禅，也住院。\n旨的全无，种田博饭。\n大笑接□白云瞎汉，无端带累遍地儿孙。\n至今东西不分，南北不辨。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14584,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"灵照女赞","author":"释法薰","text":"恶种草，生冤家。\n笊篱定价，分文不差。\n末梢犹叵耐，机先不让爷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14585,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秀长老请赞","author":"释法薰","text":"飞来峰下，龙床角畔。\n用没意志一著，师僧遭他惑乱。\n胡笳忽转阳春调，也有知音来合伴。\n描邈将来，未得一半。\n直饶即今此话大行，已是彼此两不著便。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14586,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"言法华赞","author":"释法薰","text":"脚踏木履，手指虚空。\n法华三昧，舌本玲珑。\n连书十三，如虫蚀木。\n引得一类邪徒，至今胡卜乱卜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14587,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"受业师孙请赞","author":"释法薰","text":"削发村院里，僻陋少见闻。\n信脚到南地，也作住山人。\n龙床角畔脱空话，引得衲子如蜂屯。\n思归未得，故国梦频。\n慇勤藉汝将予去，且看梨花二月春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14588,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和真歇墨迹三颂 其二","author":"释法薰","text":"纵然万象体元真，雨沐云蒸到眼新。\n开口恐成随类堕，相逢多是笑吟吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14589,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拈古十四首 其十四","author":"释法薰","text":"开田甚难，难中却易。\n展手甚易，易中却难。\n说难说易，转见颟顸。\n自己若无仙骨，谩言九转还丹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14590,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拈古十四首 其十三","author":"释法薰","text":"这老汉，手头短。\n灵隐即不然，见成公案，与汝三十棒。\n棒头有眼，龙蛇易辨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14591,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拈古十四首 其九","author":"释法薰","text":"镜清摇头，这僧摆尾。\n虽则一期可观，争奈玄沙道底。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14592,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拈古十四首 其八","author":"释法薰","text":"毡拍板，无孔笛。\n狭路相逢，五音六律。\n流落丛林知几年，至今谁敢通消息。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14593,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拈古十四首 其七","author":"释法薰","text":"南山不会禅，一向外边走。\n腊月三十日，舌头不出口。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14594,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拈古十四首 其五","author":"释法薰","text":"这僧已是露出眼睛，云门更与揭却脑盖。\n若是佛法，未梦见在。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14595,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拈古十四首 其三","author":"释法薰","text":"昨日定，今日不定。\n大小瞿昙，因邪打正。\n更问如何，钵盂安柄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14596,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拈古十四首 其二","author":"释法薰","text":"闻声悟道，见色明心。\n林鸩砧，井底种林擒。\n今年桃李贵，一颗直千金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14597,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拈古十四首 其一","author":"释法薰","text":"即心即佛，甜瓜甜彻蒂。\n非心非佛，苦瓠苦连根。\n不是心，不是佛，不是物，斫却月中桂，清光迸海门。\n个里若能开正眼，一毫头上定乾坤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14598,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拈古十四首 其十","author":"释法薰","text":"马师智藏，病痛一般。\n海兄不会，当面热瞒。\n头白头黑，言端语端。\n衲僧不用空啖啄，秤在星兮不在盘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14599,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临济和尚赞","author":"释法薰","text":"空拳捺定，喝声雷震。\n闪电光中，要分邪正。\n驾大脱空，卖无主赃。\n似恁落赖心肠，至今却有儿郎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14600,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"城中出队","author":"释法薰","text":"人家百万帝城中，应念南山彻骨穷。\n铁壁重重挨得入，笊篱无柄舀春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14601,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"总长老请赞","author":"释法薰","text":"百种无能，面冷如冰。\n与世落落，任运腾腾。\n爱将一字禅，靠倒杜衲僧。\n厨山长老，却要禀承。\n谷孤古，林鸩砧。\n各自有响音，又何必书此处无金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14602,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"昭长老请赞","author":"释法薰","text":"全无孔窍，指桑骂柳。\n瞎衲僧正眼，破东山暗号。\n三点前，三点后。\n起模画样已无端，一任傍人论好丑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14603,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"茶汤会乞颂","author":"释法薰","text":"铺心无下亦无高，一等无心次第浇。\n便是口吞三世佛，沾他涓滴也难消。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14604,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"觉城居士请赞师顶相","author":"释法薰","text":"全无寸长，但据驴性。\n不行深深海底，不立高高峰顶。\n问佛法，今日困。\n瞎衲僧眼，识毗耶病。\n素与觉城无冤，何事图形画影。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14605,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送小然还乡","author":"释法薰","text":"及早游方及早归，参禅须是后生时。\n傍人不必轻相笑，临际元呼小厮儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14606,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送圭上人归乡","author":"释法薰","text":"南高峰对北高峰，两峰矗上摩青穹。\n上人阁锡在其下，咬姜呷醋期心空。\n心空一物无依倚，却笑老胡成曲指。\n回头重觅旧家山，莫学我行荒草里。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14607,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送圭士庵归蜀","author":"释法薰","text":"昔日随流今逆流，昔时今日有来由。\n李将军本穿杨手，误向南山射石头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14608,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送琮监寺住院","author":"释法薰","text":"桐江江上一丝风，不钓盲龟只钓龙。\n浮定有无谁识意，夜凉如水月如弓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14609,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"破庵和尚赞","author":"释法薰","text":"百无能，得人憎。\n火中钓鳖，日里藏冰。\n养子不曾教，绳上更安绳。\n谷孤古东山正脉，乌户呼真本川僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14610,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古","author":"释法薰","text":"胡须赤，赤须胡。\n珠走盘兮盘走珠。\n狭路相逢誇好手，两边雪刃血模糊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14611,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610