1e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其一二六","author":"释法薰","text":"古人一期恁么道，白玉无瑕却有瑕。\n路途之乐，终不到家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14618,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其一二五","author":"释法薰","text":"指天指地，讨甚巴鼻。\n钉钉胶粘，刀刮水洗。\n儿孙一杓香汤，大似恭而无礼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14619,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其一二四","author":"释法薰","text":"秋风凋败叶，游子未归家。\n直饶归得后，无处立生涯。\n白蘋红蓼对芦花，令人长忆老玄沙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14620,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其一二二","author":"释法薰","text":"养子不及父，家门一世衰。\n过山寻蚁迹，能有几人知。\n老和尚你知我知，莫教漏泄天机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14621,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其一二一","author":"释法薰","text":"棒喝交驰如雷掣，颠言倒语三寸舌。\n南州打到北州头，瓮里何曾失却鳖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14622,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其一二○","author":"释法薰","text":"东西南北，?著磕著，四维上下，天平地平。\n佛法大有在，只是无人證明。\n咄，我行荒草里，你又入深村。\n长者长法身，短者短法身。\n袖头打领，腋下剜襟，即不问你诸人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14623,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其一一九","author":"释法薰","text":"吾常于此切，密意在汝边。\n麟龙不为瑞，鹤龟自成仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14624,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其一一八","author":"释法薰","text":"推不进前，约不退后。\n临济白拈，未是好手。\n南山不惜两茎眉，玉箸空将撑虎口。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14625,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其一一七","author":"释法薰","text":"九十日安居，遍地无行路。\n意不停玄，眼不挂户。\n布袋头开，乾坤独露。\n万里寸草无，踏著不相似。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14626,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其一一六","author":"释法薰","text":"南斗七，北斗八。\n风来树动，鱼行水浊。\n诸人三十年后眼开，莫道南山有口无舌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14627,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其一一四","author":"释法薰","text":"和尚子，莫妄想。\n怀州牛吃禾，益州马腹胀。\n南山饶你七穿八穴，也未免手中痛棒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14628,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其一一三","author":"释法薰","text":"东头贵买，西头贱卖。\n田地稳密衲僧，不妨游戏自在。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14629,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其一一二","author":"释法薰","text":"从上佛祖逆风扬尘，后代儿孙日中迷路。\n却忆禾山老古锥，逢人偏道解打鼓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14630,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其一一○","author":"释法薰","text":"祖师门下，尺水丈波。\n若也觑得破，轮王髻中珠分文不直。\n若觑不破，迦叶粪扫衣价重娑婆。\n千个万个伎死禅和，临济德山将奈何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14631,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其一○八","author":"释法薰","text":"三通鼓罢，簇簇上来。\n诸人减却多少威光，南山入地三尺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14632,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其一○七","author":"释法薰","text":"不坐空王殿，不挂本来衣。\n何须便恁么，切忌未生时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14633,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其一○五","author":"释法薰","text":"肥儱俑，无腹孔。\n不识字，有钱用。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14634,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其一○四","author":"释法薰","text":"溪东溪西水牯，四海五湖皇化。\n俱胝指头禅，一生受用不尽，赵州无拣择，五年分疏不下。\n南山忍俊不禁，今日轻酬重价。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14635,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其一○三","author":"释法薰","text":"前佛纪纲，后佛性命。\n衲僧腰间古历日，定是三年逢一闰，不知东平打破镜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14636,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其一○一","author":"释法薰","text":"布袋头结，圣凡路绝。\n蜡人冰，鹅护雪。\n西天恁么，此土还别。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14637,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其九十九","author":"释法薰","text":"深固幽远，无人能到。\n山前一片闲田，松竹清风浩浩，缺齿老胡不得妙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14638,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其九十八","author":"释法薰","text":"天无门，地无户。\n文殊维摩，撒手归去。\n衲僧向这里插得嘴，南山分半院与你住。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14639,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其九十六","author":"释法薰","text":"饱丛林，没量汉，法战当先，清机历掌。\n假饶千佛出头，也下一槌定当。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14640,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其九十五","author":"释法薰","text":"见得彻，用得亲。\n阳春不同调，入水见长人。\n可惜黄金如粪土，撒向阎浮人不顾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14641,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其九十四","author":"释法薰","text":"有祖以来，递相欺诳。\n两两三三，隔靴抓痒。\n山僧有口未曾开，早已龟毛长数丈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14642,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其九十三","author":"释法薰","text":"息虑迷源，明机自昧。\n祖师知有处，诸人不知。\n诸人知有处，祖师不会。\n知不知，会不会，国有宪章，三千条罪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14643,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其九十二","author":"释法薰","text":"取不得，舍不得，状不得。\n西天碧眼胡，尽力道不识。\n识不识，临际德山，太平奸贼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14644,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其九十","author":"释法薰","text":"巧尽拙出，水到渠成。\n举足下足，十字纵横。\n三千里外，已被南山换却眼睛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14645,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其八十八","author":"释法薰","text":"一不成，二不是。\n建立乖宗，扫除失旨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14646,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其八十七","author":"释法薰","text":"摩耶佛母，现女主身。\n退藏于密，得一以宁。\n贵无敌，富无伦。\n节逢寿庆，四海欢声。\n愿将西祖真消息，仰祝皇龄万万春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14647,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其八十六","author":"释法薰","text":"眼似流星，机如掣电。\n过得南山门，未见南山面。\n天气稍热，别时相见。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14648,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百三十三首 其八十五","author":"释法薰","text":"是句亦刬，非句亦刬。\n公案见成，打叠不辨。\n瞎驴趁队过新罗，临济德山空眨眼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14649,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]